OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers in the evening.
OL,7,FTurning mostly dry in the east
OL,8,Fovernight but still a few showers in
OL,9,Fthe Southwest. Fresh to strong winds
OL,10,Fgradually ease.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,13,Foccasional showers, these mainly in
OL,14,Fthe west while staying mostly dry in
OL,15,Fthe east. Winds will become light by
OL,16,Fafternoon. Patchy rain possible in
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
